Title:  Version 19.9.0

Seq:    13.1

Level:  3 - chapter

Class:  version

Date:   2026-11-01

Teaser:

Fixed a Markdown include problem, and added Budgeting support. 

Timestamp: 20261030171849

Body:

##### Fixed an Include Problem

When using the Markdown command to [[Include a Note or File]], and when making use of a [[Merge Template]] to [[Tailor the Display]], the include command was not being processed. This has been corrected.

##### Added Support for Budgeting

See the [[Budgeting with Notenik]] use case for complete info. 
